course: dictionary
lesson: 4426
title: Hamster: a small pet with big cheeks
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: A dictionary tells you what a word means, but the sentences around it give extra clues. «A boy in Texas woke his hamster in the daytime by poking it; the startled hamster bit his finger hard.» Woke in the daytime tells you a hamster is awake when most people are not, so it is an animal that sleeps in the day.
explain: «A hamster can stuff its cheeks so full of seeds that its head looks twice as wide.» Stuff and seeds are the clues here. A hamster has cheek pouches, and it fills them with food to carry it somewhere safe.
explain: «A short life, like a hamster's, can still be a happy one when the animal is well cared for every day.» The apostrophe in hamster's means the life of a hamster. The words short life tell you that hamsters do not live for very long.
fact: A hamster is a small, furry animal with short legs, a short tail and big cheek pouches.
fact: Hamsters are often kept as pets, and they need a cage, a wheel, fresh water, food and gentle handling.
fact: Hamsters are nocturnal: they sleep in the day and are active at night.
fact: Hamsters live about 2 to 3 years, while cats often live 12 to 18 years.
fact: Wash your hands after handling a hamster.
exercise: «A hamster can stuff its cheeks so full of seeds that its head looks twice as wide.» Where does a hamster keep its food? | In its paws | Under its ears | *In its cheek pouches | In its tail
exercise: A hamster is nocturnal. What does that mean? | It only eats in the day | It lives in the sea | *It is active mostly at night | It never sleeps
exercise: «A short life, like a hamster's, can still be a happy one.» Find and copy one word that means not long in time. | animal | cared | *short | happy
test: «The startled hamster bit his finger hard.» What does startled mean here? | Warm and cosy | Hungry and cross | Sleepy and calm | *Suddenly surprised and frightened
test: Why should you wash your hands after handling a hamster? | *To stay clean and healthy | To make the hamster happy | Because hamsters like soap | Because hamsters are wet
exam: Roughly how long do hamsters live? | *2 to 3 years | One week | 12 to 18 years | 50 years
